      "jsonPointer": "/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "One schema-validated record under .devai/state/backlog/ written by the backlog action family (ADR-GOV-0019): a finding discovered during work that belongs to no round, a proposition for a later session, a note from one agent to another, or a flaky test observed under ADR-CHK-0001. An item carries its origin session, role, and commit so it outlives the session that made it. Round attribution is optional and is never inferred. A backlog item is not a round gap: it cannot pause, resolve, or otherwise alter one.",
