          "properties",
          "resolved"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "law/schemas/campaign.schema.json",
      "sha256": "23d38995312663cb486a1af7ce3b5818c6c198c4caf1fe50fc0c1c0f5b992747",
      "jsonPointer": "/$defs/task/properties/executor/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "Optional agent executor contract (ADR-MDL-0009). Absent, campaign materialize writes a human executor. Present, it writes an agent executor with exact selection of this runtime, after checking the discipline, runtime, effort and model against law/policy/experimental-execution.json, law/policy/model-runtime-registry.json and law/policy/model-tiers.json; round dispatch --experimental still requires an in-force Owner activation that admits the selection.",
      "reference": "ADR-MDL-0009",
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "stringOffset": 34,
      "context": {
        "mode": "annotation-value",
        "observedKeywords": [
          "$defs",
          "properties",
          "description"
        ],
        "ancestorSegments": [
          "$defs",
          "task",
          "properties",
          "executor"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "law/schemas/campaign.schema.json",
      "sha256": "23d38995312663cb486a1af7ce3b5818c6c198c4caf1fe50fc0c1c0f5b992747",
      "jsonPointer": "/$defs/task/properties/review/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "Present only when the campaign review.mode is model-advisory: the advisory verdict the orchestrator recorded before the human ratified the gate (ADR-GOV-0023). Under model-advisory a task in pre_merge without this block, with a verdict that fails law/schemas/review-verdict.schema.json, or with a digest that does not match the reply cannot transition to merged. The block is advice to the ratifying human; it never satisfies a gate, merges, or authorizes an effect, and the ledger still shows a human actor on the gate, the merge, and every remote effect.",
      "reference": "ADR-GOV-0023",
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "stringOffset": 145,
      "context": {
        "mode": "annotation-value",
        "observedKeywords": [
          "$defs",
          "properties",
          "description"
        ],
        "ancestorSegments": [
          "$defs",
          "task",
          "properties",
          "review"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "law/schemas/campaign.schema.json",
      "sha256": "23d38995312663cb486a1af7ce3b5818c6c198c4caf1fe50fc0c1c0f5b992747",
      "jsonPointer": "/$defs/task/properties/review/properties/verdict/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "The verdict document extracted from the evaluator reply through the shared extractor, restated member for member from law/schemas/review-verdict.schema.json (ADR-MDL-0001) so the campaign check refuses a partial or foreign document without a cross-file reference; the reply schema stays the contract and this restatement follows it.",
      "reference": "ADR-MDL-0001",
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "stringOffset": 158,
      "context": {
