    },
    {
      "path": "law/schemas/dispatch-journal-event.schema.json",
      "sha256": "7179b2951c6d0abc048e66018932142dfea326ac57095dd5a1e770af15c982c4",
      "jsonPointer": "/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "One fsynced line of .devai/state/round-runs/<round>/dispatch-journal.jsonl (ADR-MDL-0005 D-6). Each experimental attempt appends intent, spawned, exited, evidence-written, and settled in that order. An attempt with intent but no settled is uncertain and blocks the round until a human disposition; it is never retried or replayed automatically. A human disposition (ADR-MDL-0007) is a settled event with outcome cancelled, which may close an open attempt at any boundary and names the disposition and its record.",
      "reference": "ADR-MDL-0005",
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "stringOffset": 76,
      "context": {
        "mode": "annotation-value",
        "observedKeywords": [
          "description"
        ],
        "ancestorSegments": []
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "law/schemas/dispatch-journal-event.schema.json",
      "sha256": "7179b2951c6d0abc048e66018932142dfea326ac57095dd5a1e770af15c982c4",
      "jsonPointer": "/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "One fsynced line of .devai/state/round-runs/<round>/dispatch-journal.jsonl (ADR-MDL-0005 D-6). Each experimental attempt appends intent, spawned, exited, evidence-written, and settled in that order. An attempt with intent but no settled is uncertain and blocks the round until a human disposition; it is never retried or replayed automatically. A human disposition (ADR-MDL-0007) is a settled event with outcome cancelled, which may close an open attempt at any boundary and names the disposition and its record.",
      "reference": "ADR-MDL-0007",
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "stringOffset": 366,
      "context": {
