      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "Complete optional adopter-owned producer obligations projected only by registered binding to .devai/config/invariant-producers.json. Every binding for an invariant must be discharged by exact candidate/task/result custody; generic action matching cannot substitute (ADR-SCR-0017).",
