      "jsonPointer": "/$defs/prerelease_ladder/description",
      "location": "value",
      "originalString": "Closed prerelease channel ladder (ADR-REL-0028): three rungs in order, each with a dist-tag and required capabilities, plus the promotion rules and the rc-only promotion to stable.",
